review:
A very good Souls-like:

- Its a lot of DS2:SOTFS, wich is a good thing, DS 2 is great;

- Tense Soulslike, grimy Atmosphere with great worldbuilding;

- Really good combat system with limb targeting ( dismembering for gear/weapons ), there's also a parry mechanic wich works really well;

- Normal and special bosskills for unique weapons/implants;

- A lot of shortcuts, hidden pathways, secrets, audiologs and collectibles to uncover;

- Decent enough story with good voice acting, starts of pretty stale but gets a lot better when you progress ( ! the protagonist talks ! );

- A lot of DS 2 SOTFS;

- Huge build variety and many weapons but nothing too in-depth or time consuming;

- Many many  weapons, gear, implants  to obtain;

- A lot of content to go through;

- Top tier map design: Intricate and well thought out mapdesign that will leave you lost and amazed at the same time , very much on the level of DS1!

Very fun and good performance on Steamdeck ! 

8/10
